; the warning datafrac (change type-system-rework, I8): a Data.b value with
; a point whose fraction is not zero gives the warning at its line; the
; Byte keeps the value cut towards zero (-1.5 gives -1); 1.0 has no
; fraction and gives none
Restore dfr_d
Read a.b,b.b
NPrint a
NPrint b
End
.dfr_d
Data.b -1.5,1.0
